{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他没再等一个不会伤到任何东西的办法，接着做眼前的事，久违的劲头又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"久违的劲头\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他只管把眼前能做的做好，不再逼自己每次努力都得把事情扭转过来。\",\n      \"key\": \"每次努力\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那种生活，也不想放下眼前该做的事，怕顾住这头就伤了那头，心里没底也继续往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"那份担心又冒出来，他心里晃了一下，还是带着不安往前走，不用装作不怕，也不必等犹疑消失才坚定。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着不安往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\", \"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\", \"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"S12-1保留放弃无损办法后重新行动、劲头回来的变化；S12-4补出担心重现后的短暂动摇，并明说他可以带着不安继续，不必装作不怕，也不必等犹疑消失才坚定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再要求每次努力都扭转局面的意思。行动曾带来力量，却没能消除牵挂，因此他不再逼自己靠每次努力解决所有难处。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把他同时舍不得的两边落在向往的生活和眼前该做的事上，保留怕顾此失彼、心里没底仍继续的意思，用实际承担代替抽象的责任宣言。保留S12-3编号，供后文回指。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a2b2bd73-ac61-4666-826d-039fd1db081d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190504361867Z", "elapsed_seconds": 424.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:12:08.959137+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ee2a846d78a926adf0ec67cc14f7ac39bf20becc7aaa2ec8dcd4ff820ea86817", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190504361867Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"pro